window.docContents[142].resolve({"/Postscript/#Logical-Foundations--Postscript--Looking-Back":{"contents":"We've covered quite a bit of ground. Along the way, we developed three\nconnected themes:\n\nFunctional programming:\n\n* recursive definitions over immutable data* higher-order functions* polymorphism\n\n\n\nLogic, the mathematical basis for software engineering:\n\n       logic                        calculus\n--------------------   ~   ----------------------------\nsoftware engineering       mechanical/civil engineering\n\n\n* inductively defined propositions and relations* inductive proofs* proof objects\n\n\n\nLean, an industrial-strength proof assistant:\n\n* a functional programming language* tactics for constructing proofs* proof automation\n\n","context":"Logical Foundations\u0009Postscript","header":"12.1. Looking Back","id":"/Postscript/#Logical-Foundations--Postscript--Looking-Back"}});